{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-11w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Yearn 11W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell YEARN 11W Pod System is a sleek and compact pod system, integrating a 370mAh rechargeable battery, LED battery life indicator light, and is equipped with a slew of operational and hardware safeties and protections that will guard against failure when in use. Crafted from a zinc-alloy chassis, PC, and ABS materials, the YEARN Pod System has a quality heft to the weight, without weighing down the pockets or purse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, the integrated 370mAh rechargeable battery is spacious enough to provide ample power for vaping without the need for charging in between sessions. On the face of the YEARN Pod System is a LED Battery Life Indicator Light, relaying the remaining battery life via colored LED light. Furthermore, the YEARN Pod System is equipped with a bunch of circuit protections and performance safeties to ensure a stable, safe, and reliable vaping system. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Uwell Yearn doesn't includes pods in kit.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003eUwell YEARN 11W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.7mm by 20.2mm by 10.4mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 370mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy \u0026amp; PC ABS Material Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIsolated E-Liquid Chamber Technology - Preserves Freshness of eJuice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Testing Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlug 'n' Play Cartridge Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black \u0026amp; Blue, Grey, Black \u0026amp; Violet, Black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Battery Body\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x User's Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531628126263,"sku":"U Yearn Pod System","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_yearn_11w_pod_system_-_default-min.jpg?v=1741703374","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-yearn-11w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




